---
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';

const jargon = [
  { term: 'UCIC', text: 'a bank-wide unique customer ID, used to look up an existing customer’s data. First encountered mid-requirement, undefined.' },
  { term: 'Maker–checker', text: 'one person submits an action, a different person must approve it. Assumed knowledge throughout the spec.' },
];
const resolved = [
  { term: 'CIBIL score', text: 'a credit score fetched from a bureau, similar to a FICO score. Now part of my working vocabulary.' },
  { term: 'Moratorium', text: 'a grace period before repayment begins. Documented and cross-checked with the team.' },
];
---
<section aria-label="Discover" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; background: var(--surface-page); color: #251F19; font-family: var(--font-text); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">
  <div style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: calc(var(--content-max) + 2 * var(--gutter)); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 104px) var(--gutter); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);">

    <SectionHead eyebrow="01 · Discover" title="Learning the domain from the document">Because I was new to banking, I treated the SRS as raw input to interpret, not a finished design. A large first step was building a working glossary.</SectionHead>

    <blockquote class="pull">
      <p><span class="dim">That’s not a knowledge gap.</span> It’s page after page of banking terms <span class="dim">with no glossary attached.</span></p>
    </blockquote>

    <div class="collage">
      <div class="col">
        <div class="gcard gcard--head">
          <h3>Jargon</h3>
          <p>Terms the SRS used freely, assuming a familiarity I didn’t have on day one.</p>
        </div>
        {jargon.map((j) => (
          <div class="gcard">
            <span class="gicon gicon--q" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9.2 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.8 1c0 2-3 2.6-3 4.5"/><path d="M12 18h0"/></svg>
            </span>
            <p><strong>{j.term}</strong>: {j.text}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="center" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 240 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect x="30" y="60" width="180" height="112" rx="14" fill="#00838C"/>
          <rect x="30" y="60" width="180" height="30" rx="14" fill="#006D75"/>
          <circle cx="52" cy="75" r="9" fill="#EAF4F4"/>
          <circle cx="66" cy="75" r="9" fill="#B7D8DA" opacity=".8"/>
          <rect x="46" y="112" width="70" height="8" rx="3" fill="#EAF4F4" opacity=".85"/>
          <rect x="46" y="128" width="120" height="6" rx="3" fill="#D3E7E8" opacity=".6"/>
          <rect x="46" y="142" width="90" height="6" rx="3" fill="#D3E7E8" opacity=".6"/>
          <circle cx="170" cy="200" r="26" fill="#EAF4F4"/>
          <circle cx="170" cy="200" r="26" fill="none" stroke="#002329" stroke-width="2"/>
          <text x="170" y="207" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="20" fill="#002329">$</text>
          <circle cx="196" cy="216" r="16" fill="#8FD3D6" opacity=".9"/>
          <rect x="14" y="196" width="60" height="42" rx="4" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#B7D8DA" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="22" y1="208" x2="66" y2="208" stroke="#D3E7E8" stroke-width="2"/>
          <line x1="22" y1="216" x2="66" y2="216" stroke="#D3E7E8" stroke-width="2"/>
          <line x1="22" y1="224" x2="50" y2="224" stroke="#D3E7E8" stroke-width="2"/>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="col col--right">
        <div class="gcard gcard--head gcard--ok">
          <h3>Resolved</h3>
          <p>A working glossary, built term by term, so I could design with confidence instead of guessing.</p>
        </div>
        {resolved.map((j) => (
          <div class="gcard gcard--ok">
            <span class="gicon gicon--ok" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>
            </span>
            <p><strong>{j.term}</strong>: {j.text}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.pull{margin:0;padding:clamp(4px,1vw,8px) 0 clamp(4px,1vw,8px) clamp(20px,2.4vw,32px);border-left:4px solid var(--accent);max-width:960px}
.pull p{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,30px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#251F19}
.pull .dim{color:#948B81}
.collage{box-sizing:border-box;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(160px,240px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(16px,2.4vw,32px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(24px,3.4vw,48px);border-radius:var(--radius-card);background:linear-gradient(160deg,#EAF4F4 0%,#D3E7E8 100%);border:1px solid #D3E7E8}
.col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.col--right{margin-top:clamp(0px,4vw,56px)}
.center svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.gcard{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.9);box-shadow:0 10px 26px -16px rgba(0,35,41,.3);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
.gcard p{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3B342D}
.gcard strong{font-weight:600;color:#002329}
.gcard--head{flex-direction:column;gap:6px;background:#FFFFFF}
.gcard--head h3{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#002329}
.gcard--head p{color:#4C6367}
.gcard--head.gcard--ok{background:#002329;border-color:#002329}
.gcard--head.gcard--ok h3{color:#FFFFFF}
.gcard--head.gcard--ok p{color:#8FD3D6}
.gicon{flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:999px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.gicon--q{background:#FFFFFF;border:1.5px solid #B7D8DA;color:#4C6367}
.gicon--ok{background:var(--accent);color:#FFFFFF}
@media (max-width: 900px){
  .collage{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .center{width:160px;justify-self:center;order:-1}
  .col--right{margin-top:0}
}
</style>
